# Update LLD with the code

Whenever you add, remove, or change types, APIs, ownership, or wiring, update **both**:

- `docs/lld/java-database-lld.md` (Mermaid class diagram)
- `docs/lld/java-database-lld.txt` (text LLD: types, methods, relationships, design notes)

Do this in the same change as the code. Do not leave the LLD describing stubs that are now real, or relationships that are not wired yet.

Match reality: if a type exists but is not constructed by `StorageEngine` / `Main`, say so. Keep method names and fields aligned with the Java sources.
